---
title: "sign_post_request (Legion Backend Authentication)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_extract_body: body = raw_request_body
    q_extract_body --> q_load_key: secret_key = load_signing_key()
    q_load_key --> q_compute: signature = HMAC_SHA256(secret_key, body)
    q_compute --> q_attach: set_header("X-Signature", signature)
    q_attach --> [*]: return signed_request

    note right of q_compute
        INV-001: signing string for POST is always the raw request body, not parsed/transformed
        INV-002: HMAC-SHA256 is deterministic - same body + key always produces same signature
        INV-003: secret_key must not be empty or null
    end note
